  vendorName: Actuary Albert
  offerText: Your antique furniture is uninsured! Pay my premium immediately, or
    risk financial ruin when disaster inevitably strikes your home.
  acceptResultText: You pay the steep premium. Knowing your belongings are protected
    gives you absolute peace of mind.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to pay. You spend the entire hour staring at your
    furniture, terrified that a fire might break out.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Albert's corrupt insurance firm goes bankrupt and his clients
    lose everything. Since you kept your cash safe, you invest it locally and make
    a handsome profit!
